      "comment": "MY DARLING DANCER (6) goes on top after resuming with a second at Riverina Paceway, beaten just over two metres in an NR up to 47 over 2270m and now dropping to NR up to 41. That was a sharp return from a long absence and the 1:57.2 mile rate gives the run substance. NIFTY AMBITION (2) is the main danger if he rebounds from Parkes, where he was eighth and beaten over 12 metres, as his Canberra second two back and proven Albury 1770m record keep him right in play. IVE AN IDEA (9) was disappointing at Shepparton after being near the top of betting, but her Charlton second beaten just over three metres makes her a legitimate threat if she handles the second-row draw. ROLL PLAY (3) is building in fitness and is better drawn so may be ready to show more.",
